            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple to understand. Brutal to master.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Hyphen</strong>, you must guide a constantly rotating stick through a series of intricate neon mazes. Avoid walls, dodge obstacles, outmanoeuvre enemies and survive the traps standing between you and the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It may sound simple, but every movement demands timing, precision and patience. One small mistake can send you straight back to the beginning, turning each completed section into a hard earned victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyphen is designed for players who enjoy a genuine challenge. It can be tense, frustrating and infuriating - but finally conquering a level that once seemed impossible makes it all worthwhile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when you've conquered the campaign, the challenge doesn't have to end. <strong>Create your own levels with Hyphen's Level Editor, share them through Steam Workshop, and take on Community Levels created by other players.</strong> Whether you want to build something clever, creative or downright cruel, the same tools used to create new Hyphen content are now in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanied by glowing neon visuals and an energetic original soundtrack, Hyphen delivers a fast, fluid and intensely addictive test of skill - with an ever growing collection of community made challenges waiting beyond the main campaign.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>36 challenging campaign levels</strong> filled with obstacles, enemies and traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful <strong>Level Editor</strong> for creating your own Hyphen challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full <strong>Steam Workshop integration</strong> — create, share and discover player-made levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Levels</strong> let you take on challenges created by other players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced <strong>11-track original soundtrack</strong> composed by Andrew Lloyd</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable bonus minigames</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for <strong>keyboard and controllers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls with demanding, precision-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant neon visuals</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyphen is ideal for fans of classics such as <strong>Irritating Stick</strong> and <strong>Kuru Kuru Kururin</strong>. We have increased the intensity and taken a no-nonsense approach to the level design, creating a game for players who are not afraid of a serious challenge.<br><br>Beat the campaign. Master the impossible. Then create something even worse for everyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the patience, precision and determination to reach the end?</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple to understand. Brutal to master.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Hyphen</strong>, you must guide a constantly rotating stick through a series of intricate neon mazes. Avoid walls, dodge obstacles, outmanoeuvre enemies and survive the traps standing between you and the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It may sound simple, but every movement demands timing, precision and patience. One small mistake can send you straight back to the beginning, turning each completed section into a hard earned victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyphen is designed for players who enjoy a genuine challenge. It can be tense, frustrating and infuriating - but finally conquering a level that once seemed impossible makes it all worthwhile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when you've conquered the campaign, the challenge doesn't have to end. <strong>Create your own levels with Hyphen's Level Editor, share them through Steam Workshop, and take on Community Levels created by other players.</strong> Whether you want to build something clever, creative or downright cruel, the same tools used to create new Hyphen content are now in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanied by glowing neon visuals and an energetic original soundtrack, Hyphen delivers a fast, fluid and intensely addictive test of skill - with an ever growing collection of community made challenges waiting beyond the main campaign.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>36 challenging campaign levels</strong> filled with obstacles, enemies and traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful <strong>Level Editor</strong> for creating your own Hyphen challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full <strong>Steam Workshop integration</strong> — create, share and discover player-made levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Levels</strong> let you take on challenges created by other players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced <strong>11-track original soundtrack</strong> composed by Andrew Lloyd</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable bonus minigames</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for <strong>keyboard and controllers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls with demanding, precision-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant neon visuals</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyphen is ideal for fans of classics such as <strong>Irritating Stick</strong> and <strong>Kuru Kuru Kururin</strong>. We have increased the intensity and taken a no-nonsense approach to the level design, creating a game for players who are not afraid of a serious challenge.<br><br>Beat the campaign. Master the impossible. Then create something even worse for everyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the patience, precision and determination to reach the end?</p>",
            "short_description": "Guide a constantly spinning stick through intricate neon mazes in this fast, fluid and highly challenging action/puzzle game. Turn up the volume, sharpen your reflexes and spin your way to victory!",
